.!saiv acme/shops

// -u-ka-shifted makes punctuation ignorable at the pinned
// tertiary strength (SPEC.md section 5.3), so co-op is
// enum-equal to coop; the default non-ignorable handling on the
// sibling field keeps the hyphen significant.
..lex[en-u-ka-shifted] {coop,mart}
shop=

..lex[en] {coop,mart}
plain=
